# Bluetooth captures, and anything decoded out of them. Bug reports contain device logs and
# identifiers — never commit them.
#
# Patterns are anchored to the repo root so they cannot swallow source: an earlier unanchored
# `*btsnoop*` silently untracked tools/lib/btsnoop.mjs, which both decoders import.
/bug*.zip
/bug/
/bugreport*/
/capture-out/
/*.log
/**/btsnoop_hci*.log
